/*
	[1] Object Role
	 |
	 |  This object is mainly controlled by its parent object 'o_ragParent' and 
	 |  its controller object 'o_ragSpawner'.
	 |  
	 |  As the object name suggests, it is the head of ragdoll, used to maintain
	 |  upper body balance along with legs & arms.
	 |  
	[-]
	
	[2] Note
	 |
	 |	If you want to use your own sprite on any body segment, just set the 
	 |	sprite any way you want, like normal, or by using the script 'ragdoll_spawn'.
	 |
	[-]
*/



